OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead at Charlton
OL,4,AAthletic's ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched an investigation
OL,7,Fafter a 33-year-old man was found dead
OL,8,Fat Charlton Athletic's football ground.
OL,10,FOfficers and paramedics from the London
OL,11,FAmbulance Service were called to The
OL,12,FValley stadium in south-east London on
OL,13,FTuesday morning following concerns for
OL,14,Fthe welfare of a person.
OL,16,FThe Metropolitan Police said the man
OL,17,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene. His
OL,18,Fnext of kin have been informed and are
OL,19,Freceiving support from officers.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
