OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead at Charlton
OL,4,AAthletic's ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are investigating the
OL,7,Fpossibility that the man had fallen
OL,8,Ffrom height in the early hours of
OL,9,FMonday morning. The death is currently
OL,10,Fbeing treated as unexpected as
OL,11,Finquiries continue.
